{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2023-03-08 08:29:00', 'title': 'DUKE ENERGY BEGINS OPERATION OF ITS LARGEST SOLAR PLANT', 'text': '250-MW PLANT NOW ONLINE IN NAVARRO COUNTY, TEXAS THREE COMPANIES PURCHASED OUTPUT UNDER 15-YEAR VPPAS\xa0 CHARLOTTE, N.C. , MARCH 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUKE ENERGY SUSTAINABLE SOLUTIONS (DESS), A NONREGULATED COMMERCIAL BRAND OF DUKE ENERGY (NYSE: DUK), IS NOW OPERATING ITS LARGEST SOLAR POWER PLANT EVER – THE 250-MEGAWATT (MW) PISGAH RIDGE SOLAR PROJECT IN NAVARRO COUNTY, TEXAS.'}